WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.834 --> 00:00:02.835
-Good evening, I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night".

00:00:02.835 --> 00:00:03.903
We hope you're all doing well.

00:00:03.903 --> 00:00:05.938
And now, we re going to
get to the news.

00:00:05.938 --> 00:00:07.207
During an event yesterday,

00:00:07.207 --> 00:00:08.941
celebrating the
Affordable Care Act,

00:00:08.941 --> 00:00:11.911
President Biden welcomed
former president Barack Obama

00:00:11.911 --> 00:00:13.579
back to the White House
and said,

00:00:13.579 --> 00:00:15.514
"Feels like the good ol' days."

00:00:15.514 --> 00:00:17.350
Yeah, I'll be it does.

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:20.019
The good ol' days when you were
just going out for ice cream

00:00:20.019 --> 00:00:23.789
and riding shotgun on the
Hope and Change Express.

00:00:23.789 --> 00:00:27.359
Sucks when the responsibility
is all yours, doesn't it?

00:00:27.359 --> 00:00:29.262
Turns out,
there's a world of difference

00:00:29.262 --> 00:00:32.198
between taking an Uber
and driving an Uber.

00:00:32.198 --> 00:00:33.499
[ Laughter ]

00:00:33.499 --> 00:00:35.935
President Biden
is set to sign a bill today

00:00:35.935 --> 00:00:39.204
that will increase the financial
stability and reliability

00:00:39.204 --> 00:00:40.506
of the US Postal Service.

00:00:40.506 --> 00:00:45.711
The bill is called the
Pottery Barn Act of 20222.

00:00:45.711 --> 00:00:48.014
Ivanka Trump reportedly
met yesterday

00:00:48.014 --> 00:00:49.215
with the House committee

00:00:49.215 --> 00:00:51.317
investigating the January
attack on the Capitol

00:00:51.317 --> 00:00:52.485
for nearly 8 hours.

00:00:52.485 --> 00:00:54.353
Oh, my God, you guys.
She did it!

00:00:54.353 --> 00:00:57.190
She worked an 8-hour day!

00:00:57.190 --> 00:00:59.191
[ Laughter ]

00:00:59.191 --> 00:01:01.027
I knew she could!
I knew she could.

00:01:01.027 --> 00:01:04.030
A man on a Southwest Airlines
flight was arrested

00:01:04.030 --> 00:01:06.165
over the weekend
after he was allegedly

00:01:06.165 --> 00:01:07.600
caught masturbating on board.

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:10.469
He was caught after passengers
heard clapping

00:01:10.469 --> 00:01:12.405
before the plane landed.

00:01:12.405 --> 00:01:15.141
[ Laughter ]

00:01:17.744 --> 00:01:19.311
According to the latest numbers,

00:01:19.311 --> 00:01:21.681
the second season of
the Netflix series "Bridgerton"

00:01:21.681 --> 00:01:25.618
was watched for more than
250 million hours

00:01:25.618 --> 00:01:27.020
over the last week,
which is a record

00:01:27.020 --> 00:01:29.088
for the most-viewed
English language show,

00:01:29.088 --> 00:01:31.457
even though most people
watched it on mute.

00:01:31.457 --> 00:01:33.492
[ Laughter ]

00:01:33.492 --> 00:01:36.996
And finally, today was
National Walking Day.

00:01:36.996 --> 00:01:39.899
This news first reported
by a sign in the subway.

00:01:39.899 --> 00:01:42.268
And that was a monologue,
everybody!

